# Enterprise Controls Research Dataset

## Objective

The goal is to evaluate the capabilities of embedding models and large reasoning models against an enterprise controls dataset and associated process metadata.

This is primarily a research and experimentation exercise rather than a production solution build.

Potential research areas include:

- Control clustering
- Duplicate control detection
- Semantic similarity analysis
- Taxonomy discovery
- Control quality assessment
- Relationship prediction
- Control coverage analysis
- Enterprise knowledge graph reconstruction
- Obligation-control mapping
- Embedding model benchmarking
- Hallucination benchmarking

The objective is to maximise learning during a temporary access window to embedding models and large reasoning models.

