## Control-to-Process Linkages

Approximate population:

```text
~36,000 linkage rows
```

Average linkage density:

```text
36,000
÷
6,996

≈ 5.1 process links per control
```

The actual distribution should be profiled.

The dataset should be treated as a many-to-many relationship structure.

