## Important Data Rule

The L3_Activity_UUID field contains mixed values.

Only values containing a UUID suffix should be used for joins.

Example:

### Valid

```text
Equipment Finance - 02.02.04.01 - Establish Channel KPIs - Regional Australian Location - {1054C67B-5480-401C-AF86-F5EC62590267}
```

### Invalid

```text
Consumer Finance - 05.01.09 - Collections Management
```

Rows without UUIDs should be ignored.

